  "title": "Business compliance review",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Business compliance review</h2><p>Identify the legal issue requiring attention in each independent fact pattern.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f1\">Guarantee issue</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f1\"><option value=\"Separate personal contractual liability\">Separate personal contractual liability</option><option value=\"Automatic cancellation by LLC status\">Automatic cancellation by LLC status</option><option value=\"No enforceable obligation ever\">No enforceable obligation ever</option><option value=\"Only sales-tax liability\">Only sales-tax liability</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f2\">Worker issue</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f2\"><option value=\"Classification under the applicable facts and legal test\">Classification under the applicable facts and legal test</option><option value=\"The label always controls\">The label always controls</option><option value=\"No withholding rules can apply\">No withholding rules can apply</option><option value=\"Only the worker’s preference matters\">Only the worker’s preference matters</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f3\">Director issue</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f3\"><option value=\"Potential breach of loyalty\">Potential breach of loyalty</option><option value=\"Automatic approval\">Automatic approval</option><option value=\"Only clerical error\">Only clerical error</option><option value=\"No fiduciary duty can apply\">No fiduciary duty can apply</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f4\">Payment issue</label><select id=\"reg-m2-tbs3-f4\"><option value=\"Potential indirect prohibited bribery\">Potential indirect prohibited bribery</option><option value=\"Automatic permission through intermediaries\">Automatic permission through intermediaries</option><option value=\"No recordkeeping implications\">No recordkeeping implications</option><option value=\"A required tax election\">A required tax election</option></select></div></section>",
